WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.727
Welcome to our training on the UK to US partnered carrier program.

00:00:04.727 --> 00:00:12.212
Today we will go over how to create a shipment using the UK to US partnered carrier program and

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:14.970
how this can benefit eligible selling partners.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:21.273
The UK to US partnered carrier program offers air express shipping options to ship the fulfillment

00:00:21.273 --> 00:00:26.000
by Amazon small parcels directly from UK warehouses to US fulfillment centers.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.160
The UK to US partnered carrier program helps reduce complexity by supporting selling partners with

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:38.240
more automated booking processes, shipment tracking and payments all within Seller Central.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:43.040
You could have the ability to replenish your inventory in the US without having to search

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.826
for other shipping options outside of Seller Central.

00:00:45.826 --> 00:00:48.960
Now let's look at how to book a shipment.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:54.080
Before creating your shipment, please check if your product is prohibited or requires

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:54.912
additional documentation.

00:00:54.912 --> 00:01:00.320
To create a shipment, you go to manage inventory and then click on

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:00.678
shipments.

00:01:00.678 --> 00:01:06.400
Then click on send to Amazon and select the products that you would like to ship.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:12.320
Prepare your inventory by first choosing the packaging type you will use to ship and click

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:13.760
pack individual units.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:17.120
Then select the Amazon partnered carrier option.

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:19.040
You can then select

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:25.360
your shipping date to confirm the pick up drop off date and click on get shipping cost to confirm

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:26.687
the ship date.

00:01:26.687 --> 00:01:31.111
Now select air express as shipping mode and shipping carrier.

00:01:31.111 --> 00:01:32.880
Then click on continue

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.400
to shipping parties.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:40.480
Now you can enter the company name tax identification number, contact details

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:41.680
and commodity description.

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:45.680
Then select your pick up slot with the shipping carrier.

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:46.880
Once this has

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:50.165
been completed, review the terms and conditions.

00:01:50.165 --> 00:01:53.920
If you agree, please click accept changes and

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:54.711
confirm shipping.

00:01:54.711 --> 00:02:00.640
Once the shipment is confirmed, print out the box labels and attach to each package.

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:03.093
Fill out the commercial invoice.

00:02:03.093 --> 00:02:06.560
You can find a template in the shipment creation guide.

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:13.600
Send the invoice to the email address below this video and print out a hard copy to hand to UPS.

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:17.560
It's best to have three copies of the invoice printed.

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:19.600
Once the commercial invoice has been

00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:22.988
emailed and printed, hand over the packages to your courier.

00:02:22.988 --> 00:02:25.360
You can organize to have them picked

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:30.480
up from your warehouse or you can drop it at your nearest shipping carrier station.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:32.331
Thank you for watching this video.

00:02:32.331 --> 00:02:34.800
Please be sure to check through the steps.

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:38.338
For more information, click on the links below the video.

00:02:38.338 --> 00:02:40.720
We wish you all the best and happy

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.320
selling in the U.

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:42.720
S.
